# Keep the small baseline LAMMPS trajectory fixture under version control:
# test_lammps_ext.py (python + rust parser tests) needs this stable shared
# file; it is not generated per-test. Un-ignore the dir first so git looks
# inside it, then the specific file (parent dir must be un-ignored first).
!lammps_traj_test/
!lammps_traj_test/traj.lammpstrj
